      },
      "text": "Sec. 4. Records Maintenance. The records and files of the Board are records \nof the Office of the President and upon the Board’s termination shall be \nmaintained in the physical custody of the National Mediation Board. \nVerDate Aug<31>2005 08:01 Jul 06, 2006 Jkt 208001 PO 00000 Frm 00001 Fmt 4705 Sfmt 4790 E:\\FR\\FM\\07JYE0.SGM 07JYE0cprice-sewell on PROD1PC66 with RULES2\n=== PDF page 2 of 2 ===\n38512 Federal Register / Vol. 71, No. 130 / Friday, July 7, 2006 / Presidential Documents"
